# Part 2 rebuild: raw HR trajectories, model bundles, and large result arrays
# are reproducible from chapter2/part2_regime_map and chapter2/part2_cross_regime
# code + the recorded seeds/hashes in results/. They are deliberately kept out
# of ordinary git, matching this repo's existing treatment of Part 1's raw
# rollout arrays (see chapter2/README.md, "Release, provenance, and artifact
# policy"). Every JSON/MD record, PNG figure, and hash needed to verify or
# regenerate them is still tracked.
part2_cross_regime/data/**/*.npz
part2_cross_regime/results/**/*.npz
